      "title": {
        "en": "Skilled and attentive styling staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients routinely praise stylists like Joffrey, Becca, Patrick, and Elisa for their friendliness, patience, and technical craft. Visitors appreciate that the team takes time to consult on individual hair goals, listen to preferences, and offer helpful styling advice. Reviewers describe feeling comfortable in the chair and welcome the conversational, attentive service throughout their appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 23,
      "title": {
        "en": "Precision haircuts and sharp fades"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customer feedback highlights consistent quality across classic cuts, modern fades, and detailed beard trims. Many clients report receiving compliments after visits and note that cuts retain their clean shape well after styling. One dissatisfied reviewer felt their appointment was rushed and left with stray clippings, but nearly all clients praise the polished, clean execution."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Relaxed lounge atmosphere with amenities"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Patrons frequently comment on the welcoming, spacious shop environment and upscale amenities. Several clients note enjoying refreshing beverages, comfortable seating, and a laid-back lounge setting while checking in or waiting for appointments. The salon is often described as an easy-going and inclusive space that makes grooming sessions enjoyable and relaxing."
      }
    }
  ],
